category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libiconv-devel libreadline-devel libusb1.0-devel
sdesc: "Library for transfering files over USB to casio EX-word electronic dictionaries (utilities)"
ldesc: "libexword is a library that implements the low-level OBEX commands used to
communicate Casio EX-word dictionaries."
